69,30],[9728,27.3,2011,43,73,34]],"links":[["Duval County in the Farmland Atlas","/farmland-atlas/texas/duval-county"],["ARC or PLC in Duval County","/arc-plc/texas/duval-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 16 grids runs from 1951 to 2025, 75 years. March to April and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025, October to November finished at 17% of normal on the middle of the grids, and September to October at 44%. Grid 8825 had its driest year in 2011, at 46% of normal.</p>"}
